1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:02,538
(Raj:)Really? So every other place
you've been,

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,970
(Raj:)you thought this was fine?

3
00:00:04,976 --> 00:00:07,706
(Howard:)I know you're under a lot
of pressure,

4
00:00:07,712 --> 00:00:09,142
(Howard:)so I'm gonna let that pass.

5
00:00:09,147 --> 00:00:10,877
(sighs)
Sorry. You're right.

6
00:00:10,882 --> 00:00:12,712
(Raj:)I'm so stressed.

7
00:00:12,717 --> 00:00:14,487
(Raj:)But you know what,

8
00:00:14,485 --> 00:00:16,715
(Raj:)whenever I walk
into that temple

9
00:00:16,721 --> 00:00:19,221
(Raj:)I realize that whatever happens,
it's okay.

10
00:00:19,223 --> 00:00:21,393
(Raj:)We're all part of
an immense pattern,

11
00:00:21,392 --> 00:00:24,222
(Raj:)and though we can't understand
it, we can be happy to know

12
00:00:24,228 --> 00:00:26,658
that it's-it's working its will
through us.

13
00:00:26,664 --> 00:00:29,694
(Howard:)That's nice.
(chuckles)

14
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,030
(Raj:)Whether you call it God
or the universe or the self,

15
00:00:32,036 --> 00:00:35,506
(Raj:)we're all interconnected,
and that's just a beautiful...

16
00:00:35,506 --> 00:00:39,246
Son of a bitch!
That guy just dinged my car!

17
00:00:40,211 --> 00:00:42,681
(gasps)
S-Seriously?

18
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,350
Y-You were
just gonna drive away?

19
00:00:44,348 --> 00:00:45,678
(Raj:)Like my life

20
00:00:45,683 --> 00:00:47,013
(Raj:)isn't hard enough right now.

21
00:00:47,018 --> 00:00:49,588
(Raj:)A space probe
might be destroyed,

22
00:00:49,587 --> 00:00:51,587
(Raj:)my parents are going
through an awful divorce,

23
00:00:51,589 --> 00:00:55,189
(Raj:)the guy who cuts my dog's hair
just gave her bangs!

24
00:00:55,193 --> 00:00:57,363
(Scene:)Raj.

25
00:00:57,361 --> 00:01:00,731
(Raj:)You saw her. She looks like
Jim Carrey from Dumb and Dumber!

